Rings blow up when a random number between 0 and 6 is less than the
current enchantment.  Specifically, when obj->spe > rn2(7).  Also,
rings at -5 or worse always blow up when trying to charge them.

In general, tools have no recharge limit, but the counter stops
incrementing at 7 (not sure why... there's actually a check in the
TOOL_CLASS part of recharge to prevent further incrementing).  Of
course, that's not true for magic markers!  One recharge only for
those.

